th: 700px) 65vw, (min-resolution: 2.5dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2.5) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (min-resolution: 2dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 1000px" type="image/webp" style="box-sizing: inherit;"><source data-testid="og" srcset="https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:640/1*fXHxk5foVZAL2ZR58_F5tw.png 640w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:720/1*fXHxk5foVZAL2ZR58_F5tw.png 720w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:750/1*fXHxk5foVZAL2ZR58_F5tw.png 750w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:786/1*fXHxk5foVZAL2ZR58_F5tw.png 786w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:828/1*fXHxk5foVZAL2ZR58_F5tw.png 828w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1100/1*fXHxk5foVZAL2ZR58_F5tw.png 1100w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:2000/1*fXHxk5foVZAL2ZR58_F5tw.png 2000w" sizes="(min-resolution: 4dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 4) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (min-resolution: 3dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 67vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 3) and (max-width: 700px) 65vw, (min-resolution: 2.5dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2.5) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (min-resolution: 2dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 1000px" style="box-sizing: inherit;"><img alt="" class="bz xz zf c" width="1000" height="750" loading="eager" role="presentation" src="https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:2000/1*fXHxk5foVZAL2ZR58_F5tw.png" style="box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: middle; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); width: 1144px; max-width: 100%; height: auto;"></picture></div></div><figcaption class="zg zh zi yr ys zj zk z b by u w" data-selectable-paragraph="" style="box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(107, 107, 107); font-family: sohne, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; margin-top: 10px; text-align: center; max-width: 728px;">My cursor screen (even though I mostly use Claude now… but that’s a boring picture). Photo by me</figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div class="am du" style="box-sizing: inherit; display: flex; justify-content: center;"><div class="dv bz dw dx dy dz" style="box-sizing: inherit; width: 680px; min-width: 0px; margin: 0px 24px; max-width: 680px;"><p id="e271" class="pw-post-body-paragraph zl zm tu zn b um zo zp zq uo zr zs zt zu zv zw zx zy zz aba abb abc abd abe abf abg mu cc" data-selectable-paragraph="" style="box-sizing: inherit; margin: 2.14em 0px -0.46em; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); word-break: break-word; font-style: normal; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em; font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px;"><mark class="ahs aht ae" style="box-sizing: inherit; cursor: pointer; background-color: rgb(232, 243, 232); color: currentcolor;">Most every programmer is suffering the same growing pains right now.</mark><span> </span>We’re Barry Allen (or Jay Garrick, if you’re old) with access to the Speed Force for the first time. Zooming around faster than our intent.</p><p id="4161" class="pw-post-body-paragraph zl zm tu zn b um zo zp zq uo zr zs zt zu zv zw zx zy zz aba abb abc abd abe abf abg mu cc" data-selectable-paragraph="" style="box-sizing: inherit; margin: 2.14em 0px -0.46em; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); word-break: break-word; font-style: normal; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em; font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px;">Like many of you, AI came crashing into my daily work-life. It paid dividends immediately. Things that used to take me days, I was doing in hours. I could take on large, complex, meaty projects and deliver them<span> </span><em class="abh" style="box-sizing: inherit; font-style: italic;">fast</em>.</p><p id="a346" class="pw-post-body-paragraph zl zm tu zn b um zo zp zq uo zr zs zt zu zv zw zx zy zz aba abb abc abd abe abf abg mu cc" data-selectable-paragraph="" style="box-sizing: inherit; margin: 2.14em 0px -0.46em; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); word-break: break-word; font-style: normal; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em; font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px;">I was 5 times as productive. So, the next logical step? Well, I need to work on 5 times as many things, right? And that’s what I did. That’s what a lot of my friends and peers did.</p><p id="4dcc" class="pw-post-body-paragraph zl zm tu zn b um zo zp zq uo zr zs zt zu zv zw zx zy zz aba abb abc abd abe abf abg mu cc" data-selectable-paragraph="" style="box-sizing: inherit; margin: 2.14em 0px -0.46em; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); word-break: break-word; font-style: normal; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em; font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px;">A bug report that hints an infrastructure issue? I’m on it.</p><p id="d1b8" class="pw-post-body-paragraph zl zm tu zn b um zo zp zq uo zr zs zt zu zv zw zx zy zz aba abb abc abd abe abf abg mu cc" data-selectable-paragraph="" style="box-sizing: inherit; margin: 2.14em 0px -0.46em; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); word-break: break-word; font-style: normal; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em; font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px;">A new page for managing user settings? It’s in scope now!</p><p id="15ae" class="pw-post-body-paragraph zl zm tu zn b um zo zp zq uo zr zs zt zu zv zw zx zy zz aba abb abc abd abe abf abg mu cc" data-selectable-paragraph="" style="box-sizing: inherit; margin: 2.14em 0px -0.46em; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); word-break: break-word; font-style: normal; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em; font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px;">An admin tool for block users? Put me in coach!</p><p id="2b5d" class="pw-post-body-paragraph zl zm tu zn b um zo zp zq uo zr zs zt zu zv zw zx zy zz aba abb abc abd abe abf abg mu cc" data-selectable-paragraph="" style="box-sizing: inherit; margin: 2.14em 0px -0.46em; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); word-break: break-word; font-style: normal; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em; font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px;">I had<span> </span><em class="abh" style="box-sizing: inherit; font-style: italic;">stacks</em><span> </span>of stacks of pull requests. AI was writing my linear tickets for me and responding to threads and writing project summaries. I was working on everything, everywhere, all at once.</p><p id="e309" class="pw-post-body-paragraph zl zm tu zn b um zo zp zq uo zr zs zt zu zv zw zx zy zz aba abb abc abd abe abf abg mu cc" data-selectable-paragraph="" style="box-sizing: inherit; margin: 2.14em 0px -0.46em; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); word-break: break-word; font-style: normal; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em; font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px;">But like a raccoon on head of a love-stricken chef, I wasn’t fully in control.</p></div></div></div></div></section></div></div></article><div class="am du" style="box-sizing: inherit; display: flex; justify-content: center; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: medium-content-sans-serif-font, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal;